Clef reproduced its earlier counts to within two requests on both benchmarks: {{clef.banking77.vs_blog.correct|signed}} on BANKING77 and {{clef.clinc.vs_blog.correct|signed}} on CLINC150+OOS, with the same recall on CLINC150+OOS ({{clef.clinc.recall|pct1}} against {{blog.clef.clinc.recall|pct1}}) and nearly the same precision ({{clef.clinc.precision|pct1}} against {{blog.clef.clinc.precision|pct1}}).

